Additional Notice (Security Tool Usage):

This software is a graphical interface that launches third-party, independently
licensed security tools (e.g. Nmap, Nikto, SQLMap, Hydra, Aircrack-ng, and
others) as external subprocesses. Those tools are NOT distributed as part of
this repository and remain governed by their own respective licenses. This
project grants no rights to, and assumes no responsibility for, the tools it
merely invokes.

This software must only be used against systems you own or for which you have
obtained explicit, written authorization from the system owner. Unauthorized
